{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07672","headline":"登江中孤屿赠白云先生王迥 · 孟浩然","name":"登江中孤屿赠白云先生王迥","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠清水江，水落沙屿出。\n回潭石下深，绿筱岸傍密。\n鲛人潜不见，渔父歌自逸。\n忆与君别时，泛舟如昨日。\n夕阳开返照，中坐兴非一。\n南望鹿门山，归来恨如失。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07672.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07672","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"刘文刚"}